POST {{_4VGymAPI_HostAddress}}/instructors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sin Telefono",
  "email": "sintelefono@example.com",
  "photo_url": "https://example.com/x.jpg"
}

### Error 15: teléfono con formato incorrecto (400)
POST {{_4VGymAPI_HostAddress}}/instructors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Telefono Malo",
  "email": "telmalo@example.com",
  "photo_url": "https://example.com/x.jpg",
