### Error 17: mismo email y nombre que otro monitor, sin distinguir mayúsculas (400)
POST {{_4VGymAPI_HostAddress}}/instructors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ANA GARCÍA",
  "email": "Ana@Example.com",
  "photo_url": "https://example.com/ana2.jpg",
  "phone": "+34600111222"
}

### ===================== ACTIVIDADES =====================

### Crear actividad, happy path (201)
POST {{_4VGymAPI_HostAddress}}/activities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "activity_type_id": 10,
  "instructors_id": [1, 2],
  "max_participants": 20,
  "date_start": "2030-10-12T10:00:00",
  "date_end": "2030-10-12T11:00:00"
}

### Error 39: los mismos monitores en una actividad que se solapa (400)
POST {{_4VGymAPI_HostAddress}}/activities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "activity_type_id": 20,
  "instructors_id": [2],
  "max_participants": 10,
  "date_start": "2030-10-12T10:30:00",
  "date_end": "2030-10-12T11:30:00"
}

### Errores 25, 27, 28, 29, 30: DataAnnotations (400)
POST {{_4VGymAPI_HostAddress}}/activities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instructors_id": [],
  "max_participants": 30
}

### Error 26: lista de monitores nula (400)
POST {{_4VGymAPI_HostAddress}}/activities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "activity_type_id": 20,
  "instructors_id": null,
  "max_participants": 10,
  "date_start": "2030-10-13T10:00:00",
  "date_end": "2030-10-13T11:00:00"
}

### Errores 34 y 35: no existe el tipo ni los monitores (400)
POST {{_4VGymAPI_HostAddress}}/activities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "activity_type_id": 999,
  "instructors_id": [98, 99],
  "max_participants": 10,
  "date_start": "2030-10-13T10:00:00",
  "date_end": "2030-10-13T11:00:00"
}

### Errores 36 y 37: fin antes del inicio y fechas en el pasado (400)
POST {{_4VGymAPI_HostAddress}}/activities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "activity_type_id": 20,
  "instructors_id": [3],
  "max_participants": 10,
  "date_start": "2020-10-13T11:00:00",
  "date_end": "2020-10-13T10:00:00"
}

### Error 38: CrossFit necesita 3 monitores (400)
POST {{_4VGymAPI_HostAddress}}/activities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "activity_type_id": 40,
  "instructors_id": [3, 4],
  "max_participants": 10,
  "date_start": "2030-10-14T10:00:00",
  "date_end": "2030-10-14T11:00:00"
}

